WEBVTT

00:04:59.587 --> 00:05:02.340
So if there's anybody out
there who knows a nurse,

00:05:02.381 --> 00:05:04.633
which most of you probably do,

00:05:04.675 --> 00:05:07.678
go ahead and ask them to share
a story with you about call bells

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.680
and these kinds of patients.

00:05:09.722 --> 00:05:12.058
They’re often quite amusing,
but at the time,

00:05:12.099 --> 00:05:13.976
oh, so frustrating.

00:05:16.228 --> 00:05:17.897
So, yeah,

00:05:17.897 --> 00:05:21.192
adding a new technology
or process on top of all of this,

00:05:21.233 --> 00:05:23.652
especially when going through
beta stage flaws,

00:05:23.652 --> 00:05:26.489
only adds on to the headache.

00:05:29.158 --> 00:05:31.577
And you see, nursing is changing.